### Ergebnis speichern
POST http://localhost:3000/api/results
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "exercise_id": 1,
  "score": 95
}

### Eigene Ergebnisse
GET http://localhost:3000/api/results/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
